      "comment": "Vennessa: Ursa the Drake",
      "content": "Ursa was a corrupted dragon, a devolved Angel, which (in the official manga) hounded Vennessa's wandering clan for four days and starved them before they fled to Mondstadt. In the manga it commands hilichurls in the final arena battle and is driven off when Barbatos empowers Vennessa. It was later sealed away, and the Knights of Favonius maintained the seal.",
