        "rebellion"
      ],
      "comment": "Vennessa: The Forged Treaty",
      "content": "During the rebellion a secret treaty was discovered that seemed to sell Mondstadt and its people to the Geo Archon, bearing Rex Lapis' seal. The soldiers who had served the nobles turned against them. According to Venti's Character Story, historians learned only many years later that it was fake; the story reveals that Venti himself had forged it, having once practised forgery to play pranks on the Geo Archon.",
