      "keysecondary": [
        "Vennessa",
        "ascended",
        "ascension"
      ],
      "comment": "Vennessa: Windrise and the Great Oak",
      "content": "At Windrise a huge oak is said to have grown where Vennessa ascended. Dr. Edith says it grew in the year she left; Jean's Character Story says she left a sapling that became the tree over centuries. Jean visits it for reflection, and in the Prologue Venti recovers there from Abyssal poison and from Signora's attack.",
