        "Vennessa",
        "Natlan"
      ],
      "comment": "Vennessa: The Muratans",
      "content": "The Muratans are Natlanese exiles from an ancient civil war who accepted exile and left their homeland; their kin who stayed became the Tenochtzitoc. In the 5.8 quest The Last Survivor of Tenochtzitoc, Enjou says the exiles who headed to the \"true land of wind\" were known there as Muratans. Vennessa's people were Muratans (manga), who by her day had passed down survival and combat skills more than their history.",
